# Purpose

This document defines the form engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to ensure every form supports efficient task completion, minimizes user effort, and provides a predictable experience across all operational workflows.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Form philosophy
* Form architecture
* Information flow
* Validation principles
* User guidance
* Form governance

It intentionally excludes implementation details, validation libraries, reusable input components, styling conventions, and framework-specific behavior, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to user input, ensuring forms remain understandable, reliable, and aligned with long-term product maintainability.

